<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Hage</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Hage bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Hage</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Hage bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala naxa Annabi Hage xɛɛ Darisalamu Perise mangɛ Dariyusi xa waxati (ɲɛ kɛmɛ suuli beenu Isa xa bari). Isirayilakae nu bara ɲɛ tongo solofere raba konyiya kui Perise bɔxi ma e xa kuye batui xa fe ra, kɔnɔ Ala naxa a niya Dariyusi xa e bɛɲin gbilenfe ra Isirayila bɔxi ma. E to mɛnni li, e xa taae nun Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi birin nu bara kana. E naxa wali suxu nee yailanfe ra, kɔnɔ e yaxuie naxa e tɔɔrɔ. Na kui Ala naxa Annabi Sofoni nun Annabi Hage xɛɛ Darisalamu alako e xa Isirayilakae ralimaniya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Hage to wɔyɛn Isirayila kuntigie ra, a naxa a to e mu gɛxi natɛ tongode sinden e xa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti. Ala naxa a masen e bɛ namiɲɔnmɛ saabui ra, a nu lan e xa sɛnbɛ so Ala xa banxi tife nan ma, dangi e gbe banxie tife ra. Na nu bara a niya bɔxi xa lu tɔɔrɛ kui sansi bogi xa fe ra. Baloe nu bara xurun na wakilitareɲa xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Hage to kuntigie ralimaniya, e naxa Ala xa wali suxu a fanyi ra. A naxa a fala e bɛ Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi firin nde fama tofande dangife na singe ra. Alatala naxa laayidi tongo e bɛ a xa baraka ragoro e ma na xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi findima lɔnni belebele nan na to mixie bɛ. Xa won tondi Ala xa wali suxude, a fan tondima nɛ won malide. Kɔnɔ xa won bara natɛ tongo Ala bɛ, won xa a sago raba, a niyama nɛ won ma duniɲɛigiri birin xa sɔɔnɛya. Ala wama na nan xɔn ma won bɛ, kɔnɔ fo won xa danxaniya a ma. Ala xa na natɛ raso won bɔɲɛ kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Hage xa Kitaabui</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s">Duniɲɛigiri sɔɔnɛyatareɲa fatanxi fe naxan na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />Mangɛ Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde, kike senni nde, xi singe ra, Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli bɛ, Yudaya gomina, Annabi Hage saabui ra. A man naxa yi masenyi ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosadaki xa di Yosuwe bɛ. <verse eid="HAG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, «Yi ɲama a falama, ‹A mu lan won xa Alatala xa banxi yailan sinden.›» <verse eid="HAG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Na kui, Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti e bɛ Annabi Hage saabui ra,<verse eid="HAG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />«A lanma wo tan xa lu banxi raxunmaxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:4">n tan ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kanaxi?»<verse eid="HAG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:5">«Wo wo xa wali mato.<verse eid="HAG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />Wo sansi xɔri gbegbe sima, kɔnɔ wo naxan sɔtɔma, na xurun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:6">Wo wo dɛgema, kɔnɔ wo mu lugama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:6">Wo wo minma, kɔnɔ a mu wo ralima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:6">Wo xinbeli donma ragoroma wo ma, kɔnɔ xinbeli mu bama wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:6">Wo wo xa wali sare sɔtɔma, kɔnɔ yale na wo xa yubae ma.»<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:7">«Wo wo xa wali mato.<verse eid="HAG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Wo te geya fari wuri fende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:8">wo xa n ma banxi ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:8">alako n xa binyɛ sɔtɔ naxan nafanxi n ma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:8">Alatala xa masenyi nan a ra.<verse eid="HAG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />«Wo bara wa harige gbegbe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">kɔnɔ wo dondoronti gbansan nan sɔtɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">Wo bara na xanin wo xɔnyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">n bara na fan nayensen ɲɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">Na kelixi munse ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">Na kelixi n ma banxi xa kanɛ nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">A fa li, kankan singanxi wakili ma a gbe wali tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">kɔnɔ wo mu sese rabama n gbe wali tan xa fe ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:9">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan a ra.<verse eid="HAG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />«Na fe bara a niya tunɛ ye mu goroma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:10">bɔxi mu daxamui raminima.<verse eid="HAG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />N bara a niya bɔxi nun geyae xa xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:11">wo xa mɛngi, wo xa wɛni nɛɛnɛ, wo xa ture,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:11">wo xa sansie, wo xa mixie, wo xa xurusee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 1:11">nun wo xa wali birin xa naxasi.»<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosadaki xa di Yosuwe, nun ɲama dɔnxɔɛ birin naxa e Marigi Alatala xui suxu, a naxan fixi Annabi Hage ma. Ɲama naxa gaaxu Alatala ya ra. <verse eid="HAG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Alatala xa xɛɛra Annabi Hage naxa Alatala xa yi masenyi fala ɲama bɛ, «Won birin nan a ra.» Alatala xa masenyi nan a ra.<verse eid="HAG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Alatala naxa Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli, Yudaya gomina bɔɲɛ rawutun. A man naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosadaki xa di Yosuwe nun ɲama dɔnxɔɛ bɔɲɛ rawutun. Na naxa a niya e xa e Marigi Alatala xa banxi ti wali suxu, <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde, kike senni nde, xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde ra.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nɛɛnɛ xa nɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />A kike solofere nde, xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun keren nde ra, Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti Annabi Hage saabui ra, <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />«A fala Salatiyeli xa di Sorobabeli bɛ, Yudaya gomina, nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosadaki xa di Yosuwe, nun ɲama dɔnxɔɛ bɛ,<verse eid="HAG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" />‹Nde na wo ya ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:3">naxan bara yi banxi to nu a forima ki a xa nɔrɛ kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:3">Yakɔsi tan go, wo a toma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:3">Tide yo mu na a ma wo bɛ sɔnɔn, ka?›»<verse eid="HAG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">«Sorobabeli, i i sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi Yosuwe Yosadaki xa di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">i i sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">Ɲama birin, wo wo sɛnbɛ so.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HAG 2:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">«Wo wali suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">won birin na a ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:4">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" />«N to wo ramini Misira bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:5">n nu bara yi saatɛ tongo wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:5">N xaxili na wo tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:5">wo naxa gaaxu fefe ma.»<verse eid="HAG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:6">«A gbe mu luxi n xa koore nun bɔxi rasɛrɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:6">n xa baa nun xare ramaxa.<verse eid="HAG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />N si birin nasɛrɛnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:7">e fama nɛ harige gbegbe ra n bɛ naxee fan a birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:7">Yi banxi kui rafema nɛ nɔrɛ ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:7">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" />«N tan nan gbe na gbeti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:8">n tan nan gbe na xɛɛma ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:8">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />«Nɔrɛ naxan fama lude n ma banxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:9">na dangima nɛ a singe ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:9">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:9">«N yi banxi findima bɔɲɛsa yire nan na mixie bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:9">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />Dariyusi xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde, kike solomanaani, xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde ra, Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti Annabi Hage bɛ, <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />«Alatala xa masenyi nan ya. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe maxɔrin, <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />‹Xa mixi nde sube sɛniyɛnxi sa a xa sose kui, a fa na sose din taami, wɛni, ture, xa na mu a ra donse gbɛtɛ ra naxan mu sɛniyɛnxi, na sɛniyɛnma na sube sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra?› Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe i yaabima nɛ, ‹Ade.›»<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />Annabi Hage naxa e maxɔrin, «Xa mixi nde din fure ra, a fa findi sɛniyɛntare ra, a din sese ra, na fan findima nɛ se sɛniyɛntare ra?» Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, na fan findima nɛ se sɛniyɛntare ra.»<verse eid="HAG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Na kui, Annabi Hage man naxa a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:14">«Yi ɲama na na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:14">Si naxan na n ya tode ra, e na na ki nɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:14">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:14">«E bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi mu sɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:14">e naxan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra se sɛniyɛntare nan a ra.»<verse eid="HAG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />«Yakɔsi, wo fe mato a fanyi ra naxan fama rabade keli to ma han yare.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:15">Beenun wo xa gɛmɛ dɔxɔ a boore fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:15">Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi wali kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:15">wo xa ratu yi ma:<verse eid="HAG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Wo to nu busali mɔxɔɲɛn fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:16">wo nu fu gbansan nan sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:16">Wo to nu ture litiri tongo suuli fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:16">wo nu litiri mɔxɔɲɛn gbansan nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="HAG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />N bara wo xa wali birin kana fure nun balabalanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:17">kɔnɔ wo mu tin gbilende n ma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:17">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" />«Yakɔsi, wo a mato a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:18">fe naxan fama rabade keli to ma han yare,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:18">keli yi kike solomanaani xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:18">keli Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa gɛmɛ singe dɔxɔ lɔxɔɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:18">Wo xa wo ɲɔxɔ sa na xɔn ma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="HAG 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />Mɛngi ragataxi mu na wo xa sentie kui, ka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:19">Wɛni bili, xɔrɛ bili, kɔɔbɛ bili, nun oliwi bili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:19">nee fan mu bogife hali keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:19">Kɔnɔ, fɔlɔ to ma, n fama nɛ barakɛ sade wo ma.»<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Alatala man naxa masenyi firin nde ti Annabi Hage bɛ, xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde ra.<verse eid="HAG 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />«A fala Sorobabeli bɛ Yudaya gomina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:21">‹N koore nun bɔxi rasɛrɛnma nɛ.<verse eid="HAG 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />N mangɛe ragoroma nɛ e xa kibanyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:22">N si gbɛtɛe sɛnbɛ kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:22">N sɔɔri ragisee nun e ragimae rabirama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:22">N soe nun soe ragie faxama nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:22">e ngaxakerenyi xa santidɛgɛma ra.›»<verse eid="HAG 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:23">«Na lɔxɔɛ, Sorobabeli Salatiyeli xa di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:23">n i findima nɛ n ma konyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:23">i luma nɛ alɔ n ma xurundɛ tɔnxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:23">N bara i sugandi.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAG 2:23">Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>